</div></div></div><h1 property="name">Early Surgery or Conservative Care for Asymptomatic Aortic Stenosis</h1><div class="core-relations my-3"></div><div class="contributors"><span class="authors"><span class="heading">Authors</span>: <span role="list"><span property="author" typeof="Person" role="listitem"><span property="givenName">Duk-Hyun</span> <span property="familyName">Kang</span>, <span property="honorificSuffix">M.D., Ph.D.</span></span>, <span property="author" typeof="Person" role="listitem"><span property="givenName">Sung-Ji</span> <span property="familyName">Park</span>, <span property="honorificSuffix">M.D., Ph.D.</span></span>, <span property="author" typeof="Person" role="listitem"><span property="givenName">Seung-Ah</span> <span property="familyName">Lee</span>, <span property="honorificSuffix">M.D.</span></span>, <span property="author" typeof="Person" role="listitem"><span property="givenName">Sahmin</span> <span property="familyName">Lee</span>, <span property="honorificSuffix">M.D., Ph.D.</span></span>, <span property="author" typeof="Person" role="listitem"><span property="givenName">Dae-Hee</span> <span property="familyName">Kim</span>, <span property="honorificSuffix">M.D., Ph.D.</span></span>, <span property="author" typeof="Person" role="listitem"><span property="givenName">Hyung-Kwan</span> <span property="familyName">Kim</span>, <span property="honorificSuffix">M.D., Ph.D.</span></span>, <span property="author" typeof="Person" role="listitem"><span property="givenName">Sung-Cheol</span> <span property="familyName">Yun</span>, <span property="honorificSuffix">Ph.D.</span></span><span data-displayed-on="all">, <span data-action="reveal" tabindex="0" role="button">+5</span> </span><span data-hidden-on="all">, <span property="author" typeof="Person" role="listitem"><span property="givenName">Geu-Ru</span> <span property="familyName">Hong</span>, <span property="honorificSuffix">M.D., Ph.D.</span></span></span><span data-hidden-on="all">, <span property="author" typeof="Person" role="listitem"><span property="givenName">Jong-Min</span> <span property="familyName">Song</span>, <span property="honorificSuffix">M.D., Ph.D.</span></span></span><span data-hidden-on="all">, <span property="author" typeof="Person" role="listitem"><span property="givenName">Cheol-Hyun</span> <span property="familyName">Chung</span>, <span property="honorificSuffix">M.D., Ph.D.</span></span></span><span data-hidden-on="all">, <span property="author" typeof="Person" role="listitem"><span property="givenName">Jae-Kwan</span> <span property="familyName">Song</span>, <span property="honorificSuffix">M.D., Ph.D.</span></span></span><span data-hidden-on="all">, <span property="author" typeof="Person" role="listitem"><span property="givenName">Jae-Won</span> <span property="familyName">Lee</span>, <span property="honorificSuffix">M.D., Ph.D.</span></span></span>, and <span property="author" typeof="Person" role="listitem"><span property="givenName">Seung-Woo</span> <span property="familyName">Park</span>, <span property="honorificSuffix">M.D., Ph.D.</span> <a class="orcid-id" href="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2941-515X" property="identifier" aria-label="ORCID identifier" target="_blank">https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2941-515X</a></span><span data-displayed-on="none" data-on-display="all" aria-hidden="true"> <span data-action="hide" tabindex="0" role="button">-5</span></span></span></span><a href="https://www.nejm.org/doi/full/10.1056/NEJMoa1912846#tab-contributors" class="to-authors-affiliations" data-id="article-authors-viewall">Author Info &amp; Affiliations</a></div><div class="core-self-citation"><div class="core-date-published">Published <span property="datePublished">November 16, 2019</span></div><div property="isPartOf" typeof="Periodical"><span property="name">N Engl J Med</span> 2020<span property="isPartOf" typeof="PublicationVolume">;<span property="volumeNumber">382</span></span>:<span property="pageStart">111</span>-<span property="pageEnd">119</span></div><div class="doi">DOI: 10.1056/NEJMoa1912846</div><div class="core-enumeration"><a href="https://www.nejm.org/toc/nejm/382/2"><span property="isPartOf" typeof="PublicationVolume">VOL. <span property="volumeNumber">382</span></span> <span property="isPartOf" typeof="PublicationIssue">NO. <span property="issueNumber">2</span></span></a></div><div><a href="https://www.nejm.org/doi/full/10.1056/NEJMoa1912846#tab-information">Copyright © 2019</a></div></div><div class="info-panel"><div class="info-panel__left-content"><div class="info-panel__metrics info-panel__item"></div></div><div data-location="tools_article" aria-label="article tools" role="group" class="info-panel__right-content"><div class="info-panel__article_tools info-panel__item">



        
