olar</a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="biblioentry" data-has="label"><div class="label">17.</div><div id="core-collateral-r17" class="citations"><div class="citation"><div class="citation-content">Leon MB, Smith CR, Mack M, et al. Transcatheter aortic-valve implantation for aortic stenosis in patients who cannot undergo surgery. <em>N Engl J Med</em> 2010;363:1597-1607.</div><div class="external-links"><div class="to-citation__wrapper"><a class="to-citation" href="https://www.nejm.org/doi/full/10.1056/NEJMoa1912846#core-r8-4" target="_self"><i class="icon-return" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Go to Citation</span></a></div><div class="core-xlink-crossref"><a href="https://www.nejm.org/servlet/linkout?suffix=e_1_3_4_18_2&amp;dbid=4&amp;doi=10.1056%2FNEJMoa1912846&amp;key=10.1056%2FNEJMoa1008232&amp;site=mms-site" target="_blank">Crossref</a></div><div class="core-xlink-pubmed"><a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/20961243/" target="_blank">PubMed</a></div><div class="core-xlink-isi"><a href="https://gateway.webofknowledge.com/gateway/Gateway.cgi?GWVersion=2&amp;DestApp=WOS_CPL&amp;UsrCustomerID=5e3815c904498985e796fc91436abd9a&amp;SrcAuth=atyponcel&amp;SrcApp=literatum&amp;DestLinkType=FullRecord&amp;KeyUT=WOS%3A000283242700004" target="_blank">Web of Science</a></div><div class="core-xlink-google-scholar"><a href="https://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?title=Transcatheter+aortic-valve+implantation+for+aortic+stenosis+in+patients+who+cannot+undergo+surgery.&amp;publication_year=2010&amp;journal=N+Engl+J+Med&amp;pages=1597-1607&amp;doi=10.1056%2FNEJMoa1008232&amp;pmid=20961243" target="_blank">Google Scholar</a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="biblioentry" data-has="label"><div class="label">18.</div><div id="core-collateral-r18" class="citations"><div class="citation"><div class="citation-content">Smith CR, Leon MB, Mack MJ, et al. Transcatheter versus surgical aortic-valve replacement in high-risk patients. <em>N Engl J Med</em> 2011;364:21